{"id":"ea2fe912b97fa517","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction.md","title":"同端点的不同一步证明","display":"ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction — 同端点的不同一步证明","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction","aliases":["56-ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction"],"display":"ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction — 同端点的不同一步证明","depends_on":["[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]"],"source_section":"§8.2 Example 8.2.20(iii); Proposition 8.2.22","source_printed_pages":"323–325","source_ocr_blocks":[344,345,346],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local","source_proof_status":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction — 同端点的不同一步证明"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.2 Example 8.2.20(iii); Proposition 8.2.22"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"323–325"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>344</span><span>345</span><span>346</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; typed-open-term-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-structural-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,f\">\\(a,f\\)</span> 为互异函数符号，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=\\{a,f\\}\">\\(\\mathcal F=\\{a,f\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(a)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(a)=0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ar}(f)=1\">\\(\\operatorname{ar}(f)=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\">\\(\\mathcal F\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=(f(x),x)\">\\(\\lambda=(f(x),x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{\\lambda\\}\">\\(R=\\{\\lambda\\}\\)</span>。使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=f(f(a)),t=f(a)\">\\(s=f(f(a)),t=f(a)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=(\\epsilon,f(x),x),v=(\\langle1\\rangle,f(x),x)\">\\(u=(\\epsilon,f(x),x),v=(\\langle1\\rangle,f(x),x)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(s,u,t),(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\qquad u\\ne v.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(s,u,t),(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\qquad u\\ne v.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_R(s,u,t)=\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(f(a))),\\qquad e_R(s,v,t)=\\mathsf F(f;\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(a))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_R(s,u,t)=\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(f(a))),\\qquad e_R(s,v,t)=\\mathsf F(f;\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(a))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"e_R(s,u,t)\\ne e_R(s,v,t),\\qquad(S_R(e_R(s,u,t)),T_R(e_R(s,u,t)))=(S_R(e_R(s,v,t)),T_R(e_R(s,v,t)))=(s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[e_R(s,u,t)\\ne e_R(s,v,t),\\qquad(S_R(e_R(s,u,t)),T_R(e_R(s,u,t)))=(S_R(e_R(s,v,t)),T_R(e_R(s,v,t)))=(s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个具体收缩分别位于根和第一个子项，见证树的根标签不同，故不相等。它说明只记项对会丢失trace和残余所需的步身份；这里没有据此断言两步置换等价。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的Terese (2003)本地DjVu；书页为印刷页，OCR块按U+001F从1编号。源文件及规范化文字哈希已与前轮重核。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a,f$ 为互异函数符号，$\\mathcal F=\\{a,f\\}$，$\\operatorname{ar}(a)=0$、$\\operatorname{ar}(f)=1$，$\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})$。$V$ 为与 $\\mathcal F$ 不交的可数无限变量集，$x\\in V$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$。取 $\\lambda=(f(x),x)$、$R=\\{\\lambda\\}$。使用 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]；$s=f(f(a)),t=f(a)$，$u=(\\epsilon,f(x),x),v=(\\langle1\\rangle,f(x),x)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"a,f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F=\\{a,f\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(a)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ar}(f)=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=(\\mathcal F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda=(f(x),x)","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{\\lambda\\}","display":false},{"tex":"s=f(f(a)),t=f(a)","display":false},{"tex":"u=(\\epsilon,f(x),x),v=(\\langle1\\rangle,f(x),x)","display":false},{"tex":"(s,u,t),(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R,\\qquad u\\ne v.","display":true},{"tex":"e_R(s,u,t)=\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(f(a))),\\qquad e_R(s,v,t)=\\mathsf F(f;\\mathsf L(\\lambda;\\operatorname{Id}_R(a))).","display":true},{"tex":"e_R(s,u,t)\\ne e_R(s,v,t),\\qquad(S_R(e_R(s,u,t)),T_R(e_R(s,u,t)))=(S_R(e_R(s,v,t)),T_R(e_R(s,v,t)))=(s,t).","display":true}],"bytes":1812,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-proofterm-occurrence-distinction.md]]"}],"outgoing":["c273fed319bca9e3"]}